                                Yellow  Coldplay
      ╭ Keybindings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
      │                                                                  │
      │  ?           Toggle help overlay                                 │
      │  r           Refetch lyrics                                      │
      │  f           Toggle fullscreen                                   │
      │  t           Toggle title bar                                    │
      │  s           Toggle status bar                                   │
      │  m           Cycle mode: normal/block/kinetic/cylinder/canvas3d  │
      │  w           Toggle word highlight                               │
      │  Tab         Peek at hidden status bar                           │
      │  S           Cycle style preset                                  │
      │  [           Shift timing -100 ms                                │
      │  ]           Shift timing +100 ms                                │
      │  \           Reset timing offset                                 │
      │  -           Scroll speed -10%                                   │
      │  =, +        Scroll speed +10%                                   │
      │  0           Reset scroll speed                                  │
      │  {           Crawl tilt -5°                                      │
      │  }           Crawl tilt +5°                                      │
      │  ,           Spawn height -2%                                    │
